+	  Diagnostic platform driver for the on-SoC MT6631 connectivity
+	  subsystem (consys@18070000). Maps the vendor DT register windows and
+	  reports chip life signs. The real wlan driver will build on this.
+
+config A3_WMT_BRIDGE
+	tristate "OPPO A3 MT6771 wmt platform bridge"
+	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK
+	help
+	  Platform side of the vendor wmt <-> gen4m bridge for the MT6631
+	  connectivity subsystem. Provides thermal query / clock dump / assert
+	  trigger callbacks; the vendor wmt_drv consumes these through
+	  wmt_export_platform_bridge_register().
+
+config A3_WMAC
+	tristate "OPPO A3 MT6771 WiFi MAC skeleton"
+	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK && MAC80211
+	help
+	  mac80211-side skeleton for the MT6631 wifi@180f0000 node. Allocates
+	  the ieee80211_hw with the MT6631 band set and stubs every op; probe
+	  ends with -EPROBE_DEFER so the real protocol core can take over.
+
+config A3_WMT_DRV
+	tristate "OPPO A3 MT6771 wmt_drv (consys power/firmware core)"
+	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK
+	help
+	  Vendor wmt core (from xiaomi-mt6789-devs connectivity_common): chip
+	  power sequencing, firmware download, BT/GPS/FM function control for
+	  the MT6631. Needs the btif headers staged under drivers/staging/btif.
+
+config A3_WLAN_ADAPTOR
+	tristate "OPPO A3 wlan_adaptor chrdev layer"
+	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK
+	help
+	  Vendor wlan_adaptor (wmt_cdev_wifi.c and friends). Provides the
+	  update_driver_loaded_status / get_low_latency_mode / reset hooks that
+	  gen4m links against.
+
+config A3_GEN4M
+	tristate "OPPO A3 gen4m WLAN driver"
+	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK && MAC80211 && CFG80211
+	help
+	  Vendor gen4m WLAN core (from xiaomi-mt6789-devs
+	  connectivity_wlan_core_gen4m). This is the driver that creates the
+	  wlan0 interface on the MT6631.
+
+config A3_WMT_STUBS
+	tristate "OPPO A3 MT6771 wmt stub symbols"
+	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK
+	help
+	  Stub implementations for vendor wmt symbols the glue layer references.
+
+config A3_BTIF
+	tristate "OPPO A3 MT6771 BTIF transport"
+	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK
+	help
+	  MediaTek BTIF serial transport used by the wmt ROM patch download.
+	  Requires the vendor btif sources (see script/import-vendor-wireless.sh).
